  "details": "After recently going through with upgrading my internet everything was working fine for a few days to a week before VCR began constantly disconnecting me every time I loaded in a new avatar, or if I stayed in a world for 2 minutes or less. This problem persisted even when I switched the game back to the release version. I was told that the issue was probably caused by VRC being unable to handle rapid ISP switching, but even then, I can't exactly be sure. All I want is for the devs to check out this problem so the game will be playable again for me and everyone else who has the issue.",
